<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's jobless fell 0.6 pct mth/mth in Aug.</title>
<headline>Portugal's jobless fell 0.6 pct mth/mth in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of registered unemployed in Portugal fell 0.6 percent month-on-month in August to 452,738, up 7.7 percent year-on-year, the Institute for Employment and Professional Training (IFEP) said.</p>
<p>NOTE - The IEFP does not express the number of unemployed as a percentage of the total labour force. Its figures for the number of people out of work are consistently higher than those of the National Statistics Institute (INE) -- the government's official yardstick for unemployment.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
